Description: Fast PDF reader, editor and signer
 Katna PDF reads, edits, fills, signs and organizes PDF files, and opens
 large technical drawings quickly. It signs with certificate files and
 USB tokens (PAdES), and keeps a library of your PDFs. This package
 holds the app and katna-pdf-cli, its command-line tool.
